# ADD is analogous to MULTIP.
#
# That is all the report says. This table is ours and does whole numbers
# only: TS 18 plus TS 20 goes to TS 22, and TS 23 is cleared. TS 2, 4, 5, 6
# and 8 are altered.
#
# ADD is also the name of an instruction, so the head of this table is
# written with the full stop the report gives CALPOL.
ADD.
  1   TS 18 - TS 2
  3   ADD 'A'
  4   TS 20 - TS 2
  6   ADD
  7   TS 4 - TS 22
  9   CLEAR TS 23
 12   B, UNBURY
